What is Airdry?
Ans: The Airdry hair dryers are a set of versatile blow dryers from Philips. These dryer units, with a sleek, metallic coating, work at temperatures of up to 300 F, and help the user avoid hair damage. Airdry comes in two models, namely: Airdry 2120m1.7H1.7H5H1K and Airdry 2120m1.7T1.2T5T1K. The main differences between them are the power they consume.
The Airdry features a modern design and a wide choice of accessories. The heat settings range from low to high, and have various functions. The Airdry also comes with a cool shoot button - an option that is a real game-changer for people who do not like using a flat iron. To control the dryer during the styling process, the Airdry comes with an extension cord. The only negative aspect of this brand is its high price.
Airedry 2120m1.7H1.7H5H1K features a detachable brush and a flexible hose, which makes styling at home much easier. The dryer is also equipped with a travel cable and the option to use the dryer while on-the-go, thanks to its durable nature. These features make both of these dryers perfect for styling hair in style.
